Corresponding source
--------------------

Complete corresponding source for every binary published alongside this notice
is the repository below, at the commit named in the release. That repository
does not vendor the engine: it pins it as a submodule and carries the
modifications as patch files, so reproducing a published binary needs all three
of the pieces listed here.

    This work        https://github.com/jeroenvervaeke/embedded-mongo

    Upstream engine  https://github.com/mongodb/mongo
    Pinned commit    e08eb5e22f1658f5074139e535efb9c68c15c41c

    Modifications    patches/ in this repository, applied to the submodule by
                     scripts/apply-mongo-patches:

                       0001  trim the embedded ICU collation locales
                       0002  do not abort when logging a sessionless client
                       0003  remove the slot-based execution engine
                       0004  drop the replication implementation
                       0005  drop the sharding runtime
                       0006  drop the network stack

                     Further modifications live in
                     embedded-mongodb-sys/native/, which supplies the library's
                     entry points and its standalone sharding state.

    Build            embedded-mongodb-sys/build_native.rs holds the exact Bazel
                     invocation, and docs/native-size-reduction.md explains what
                     each flag and patch is for. Reproduce with
                     EMBEDDED_MONGODB_BUILD_FROM_SOURCE=1 cargo build --release.


